## 🧠 What a Connection represents

It is NOT a zone.

It is an edge:

* zone A → zone B
* optional capacity limit

---

## 🧩 YOUR TASK

Design attributes:

* start zone name or reference
* end zone name or reference
* max_link_capacity (default = 1)

---

## ⚠️ Important decision

